ef 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186396605 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "85442eb9-7db8-592f-9879-ddfd77d97231" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399587 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186399588 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399587 #edb/ref 1069 "q-106944" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399587 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399587 #edb/ref 1071 "From top to bottom, fill in the blanks and hence complete the proof of the following statement using the axioms $[\\text{A}1]-[\\text{A}8]$ given below.\n\n*Statement: *\n\n*$0\\cdot 0=0$* \n\n*Proof:*\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0\\cdot 0 & =0\\cdot 0 &  & [\\,\\text{given}\\,] \\\\ 0\\cdot 0 & =0\\cdot 0+0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom __}\\,\\,] \\\\ 0\\cdot 0 & =0\\cdot 0+1\\cdot 0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom __}\\,\\,] \\\\ 0\\cdot 0 & =(0+1)\\cdot 0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom A7}\\,] \\\\ 0\\cdot 0 & =1\\cdot 0 &  & [\\,\\text{addition of integers}\\,] \\\\ 0\\cdot 0 & =0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom A5}\\,]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe axioms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{[A1]}:x+y=y+x & \\text{[A5]}:1\\cdot x=x \\\\ \\text{[A2]}:(x+y)+z=x+(y+z) & \\text{[A6]}:\\alpha (\\beta x)=(\\alpha \\beta )x \\\\ \\text{[A3]}:x+0=x & \\text{[A7]}:(\\alpha +\\beta )x=\\alpha x+\\beta x \\\\ \\text{[A4]}:x+(-x)=0 & \\text{[A8]}:\\alpha (x+y)=\\alpha x+\\alpha y\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399587 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "258def85-3c26-5841-81d2-c1a1f3c916a4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399587 #edb/ref 1074 "Using the vector space axioms, we obtain the following: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0\\cdot 0 & =0\\cdot 0 &  & [\\,\\text{given}\\,] \\\\ 0\\cdot 0 & =0\\cdot 0+0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom }\\text{A3}\\,] \\\\ 0\\cdot 0 & =0\\cdot 0+1\\cdot 0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom }\\text{A5}\\,] \\\\ 0\\cdot 0 & =(0+1)\\cdot 0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom A7}\\,] \\\\ 0\\cdot 0 & =1\\cdot 0 &  & [\\,\\text{addition of integers}\\,] \\\\ 0\\cdot 0 & =0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom A5}\\,]\\end{aligned}\n$$" #e